  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fsA42pp6cuX\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/discord.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/pnk2u/More-Rail-Variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/github.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fpnku\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pnku/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/buttons/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252flieonstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/badges/a-creation-by-lieon-studio.svg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-stick-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/pnk2u/resources/main/ModProjects/More-Stick-Variants/badge/requires-mstv.svg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<h1>更多鐵軌變體</h1>\n<p>看膩了千篇一律的軌道？讓來自森林中各種顏色的木材，為你的 <del>火車</del>……礦車旅程增添色彩。包含全部三種變體：激活鐵軌、偵測鐵軌和動力鐵軌。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/driqu.webp\" alt=\"\"> <sup>一條擁有大量鐵軌和多樣木材類型的礦坑隧道。（使用來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把變體 (MStV+)</a> 的搭配火把。）</sup></p>\n<h2>為 Minecraft 新增 44 種鐵軌變體（每種類型各 11 種）。</h2>\n<h2>兼容 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a> 1.3.0+ 的方塊替換功能：</h2>\n<p>推薦使用的 Quad 版本：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/quad/files/5695583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1.3.0-beta.5 for 1.21(.1)</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://uwu.catgirl.host/i/75nqy.webp\" alt=\"\"><br>\n觀察峽谷礦坑隧道中的一段：我們可以看到，遊戲現在生成的是 <em><strong>深色橡木鐵軌</strong></em> 和 <em><strong>深色橡木板火把</strong></em>，而不是常規的 <em>橡木鐵軌</em> 和 <em>橡木火把</em>（來自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-torch-variants\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多火把變體</a>）。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/images/strip/lol.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
